5
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,990
The 11 players of Nankatsu and Meiwa are giving it their all...

6
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,870
...but the score is 2-2!

7
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:25,560
Will there be a side that seizes victory?

8
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:28,880
Or will both teams become champions?

9
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:33,630
The final kick-off of the tournament will take place with the referee's whistle.

10
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:37,390
As we promised, we didn't concede a goal in the first half.

11
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:40,260
The rest is up to you, Tsubasa and Misaki.

12
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,080
Tsubasa! Misaki!

13
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,730
In the second half, we're entrusting it to the golden duo!

14
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:48,150
Even if my leg breaks, I'll play until the very last moment!

15
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,150
I will definitely score.

16
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:54,440
Otherwise, I will have wasted everyone's efforts in the first half!

17
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,500
Bring it on!

18
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,410
I'd rather die than concede a goal.

19
00:00:58,410 --> 00:00:59,780
We won't lose.

20
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:02,870
No matter what kind of plan you've made!

21
00:01:02,870 --> 00:01:04,660
We'll just attack!

22
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,920
Let's go, Misaki-kun!

23
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,780
Okay!

