48
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:44,720
Episode 27:
Time for Victory

49
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:44,720
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

50
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,840
The last 5 minutes!

51
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,260
Push, Nankatsu!

52
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:47,680
Don't you lose, Meiwa!

53
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,480
You are definitely the champions!

54
00:02:50,980 --> 00:02:54,250
Come on! We'll attack until the very last moment!

55
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:56,080
We'll steal the ball and go on the attack!

56
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:59,020
We'll show Meiwa's football until the end!

57
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,070
Yes!

58
00:03:03,490 --> 00:03:05,500
Tsubasa-kun dribbles past.

59
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:09,000
Wonderful moves showing that he rested in the first half!

60
00:03:13,330 --> 00:03:15,210
I will definitely score!

61
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:17,590
Misaki-kun!

62
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:20,840
Now he also tricks his opponents and makes a great pass!

63
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,760
I won't allow it!

64
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:25,970
He dodges! Misaki-kun's movements are excellent too!

65
00:03:25,970 --> 00:03:28,390
Nankatsu's golden duo is revived!

66
00:03:28,390 --> 00:03:29,810
Alright, we can do this!

67
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:33,720
He lost his balance!

68
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,850
The injury on his leg seems serious.

69
00:03:36,730 --> 00:03:37,730
Misaki-kun!

70
00:03:40,270 --> 00:03:42,490
Hyuga-kun steps forward and gets the ball.

71
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:44,830
Alright, we'll score the goal!

72
00:03:44,830 --> 00:03:45,530
Yes!

73
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:49,910
While Hyuga-kun advances quickly through the middle, Meiwa launches a fast attack!

74
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:54,600
Will Misaki really not be able to handle it?

75
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,250
Taro...

76
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:56,880
Everyone! Stay calm!

77
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,640
Believe in Misaki!

78
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:00,240
He will definitely pull it off!

79
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,240
We'll stop this attack!

80
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:02,880
Yes.

81
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,430
I won't allow it!

82
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:09,010
Do your best, kids!

83
00:04:09,010 --> 00:04:11,920
My leg has reached its limit too.

84
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:17,020
But I have to stop this Meiwa attack right here.

85
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:19,520
I beg you. Hold on just a little longer, my leg.

86
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,080
Everyone is doing this for me...

87
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,050
Damn it!

88
00:04:23,050 --> 00:04:25,590
Was this going to be the end of Misaki Taro?

89
00:04:25,590 --> 00:04:27,780
Give me one last strength.

90
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:29,450
Dad!

91
00:04:29,450 --> 00:04:31,290
Mom!

92
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:33,660
Hyuga-san!

93
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,570
Oh no!

94
00:04:35,570 --> 00:04:38,210
The unmarked Hyuga-kun receives the pass!

95
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:40,710
Hyuga-kun shoots!

96
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:42,380
Will it be a goal?!

97
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,650
No, he blocks it!

98
00:04:45,650 --> 00:04:48,510
Tsubasa-kun stops Hyuga-kun's shot!

99
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,390
What?!

100
00:04:49,390 --> 00:04:50,220
Tsubasa!

101
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:53,060
Misaki-kun, counter-attack!

102
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:56,050
To Misaki-kun, who couldn't fully commit to the game because of his leg injury...

103
00:04:56,050 --> 00:04:58,310
...Tsubasa-kun still sends the pass.

104
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:01,320
My one and only partner is Misaki-kun.

105
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:03,140
You can do it, Misaki-kun!

106
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:06,610
Let's show our final golden duo play!

107
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:08,490
Tsubasa-kun.

108
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:10,700
Dad!

109
00:05:11,290 --> 00:05:12,370
Mom!

110
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:14,500
This is my final play!

111
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:18,210
Misaki-kun moves forward, enduring the pain in his leg!

112
00:05:22,170 --> 00:05:23,130
What?!

113
00:05:24,590 --> 00:05:25,590
Misaki!

114
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:26,720
Misaki-kun!

115
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,300
Tsubasa-kun is right behind him!

116
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,940
There it is, finally!

117
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:38,140
This is the play of Nankatsu's golden duo!

118
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:42,060
A wonderful passing synchronization that will confound the defense!

119
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:44,570
Misaki-kun, keep it up!

120
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:47,430
Take this, Wakashimazu!

121
00:05:50,110 --> 00:05:52,910
However, it's not a goal!

122
00:05:52,910 --> 00:05:54,490
You're the man, Wakashimazu!

123
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,200
I'll take it.

124
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,940
Ishizaki-kun saves the ball.

125
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:58,790
Ishizaki-kun!

126
00:05:58,790 --> 00:06:00,420
Tsubasa! Misaki!

127
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:02,340
Count me in too!

128
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:03,170
Take it!

129
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:05,340
Ishizaki-kun sends a cross.

130
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:07,840
However, Hyuga-kun is there to stop it.

131
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,010
I'm coming!

132
00:06:09,010 --> 00:06:11,970
This is Misaki-kun's overhead kick!

133
00:06:11,970 --> 00:06:13,010
Misaki!

134
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:22,020
But their timing is completely off!

135
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:22,900
What?!

136
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:23,770
Tsubasa-kun!

137
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:32,260
While Misaki-kun did it to set a trap, Tsubasa-kun goes for the overhead kick!

138
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:35,990
The late-arriving overhead kick of Nankatsu's golden duo!

139
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:38,870
Go!

140
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:44,130
I-It's in! Goal!

141
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:51,000
- You did it!
- Amazing, Tsubasa!

142
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,430
Wonderful goal!

143
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:54,180
- That's it!
- We did it!

144
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:56,020
Nankatsu's golden duo displays wonderful teamwork.

145
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:59,670
A minute and a half of the final extra time has passed...

146
00:06:59,670 --> 00:07:02,560
...and Nankatsu finally takes the lead!

147
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,660
Tsubasa! Misaki!

148
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:07,320
Wakabayashi-san's plan worked.

149
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:09,610
- Tsubasa!
- Tsubasa...

150
00:07:09,610 --> 00:07:12,540
Hyuga-kun was tricked by Misaki-kun's jump.

151
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:15,740
He couldn't stop Tsubasa-kun's overhead kick.

152
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:21,390
Even Wakashimazu-kun was unable to react to this shot.

153
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:22,370
Damn it!

154
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:26,880
The teamwork of Nankatsu's golden duo is perfect!

155
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,130
Misaki-kun...

156
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:29,090
Tsubasa-kun!

157
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:31,420
Well done, Taro.

158
00:07:31,420 --> 00:07:32,930
Taro...

159
00:07:32,930 --> 00:07:36,070
But there are still 3 minutes left.

160
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:39,840
No one expects the merciless tiger, Hyuga-kun, to give up.

161
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,490
Don't lose, Kojiro.

162
00:07:41,490 --> 00:07:43,230
Don't lose hope!

163
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:44,840
Big brother...

164
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,310
Kojiro...

165
00:07:46,310 --> 00:07:49,220
That's to be expected from Tsubasa and Misaki.

166
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:54,290
You display teamwork as if you're communicating mentally.

167
00:07:54,290 --> 00:07:57,280
But I haven't lost yet!

168
00:07:58,780 --> 00:08:01,750
Meiwa FC immediately goes on the attack with the kick-off!

169
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:04,460
They have the determination to equalize!

170
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:07,170
Everyone! Don't lower your guard just because we're ahead!

171
00:08:07,170 --> 00:08:09,060
Stay focused!

172
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:09,880
Okay!

173
00:08:11,550 --> 00:08:14,380
Just hold on a little longer. I beg you.

174
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:16,180
Grit your teeth, Misaki-kun.

175
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:17,570
Just a little more.

176
00:08:17,570 --> 00:08:18,730
Yes.

177
00:08:18,730 --> 00:08:20,710
Tsubasa... Misaki...

178
00:08:20,710 --> 00:08:25,140
You taught me that I can't play football alone.

179
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:26,990
Hyuga-san!

180
00:08:26,990 --> 00:08:30,940
And also that football isn't just about power.

181
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:35,330
But most importantly, what I felt while fighting against you...

182
00:08:35,330 --> 00:08:36,950
...was the true joy of football!

183
00:08:36,950 --> 00:08:40,920
Football is truly very enjoyable.

184
00:08:41,950 --> 00:08:45,050
Hyuga-kun advances quickly towards the Nankatsu goal.

185
00:08:45,050 --> 00:08:47,540
Meiwa's attack is very balanced.

186
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,400
Stop them!

187
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:49,920
Don't let him get close!

188
00:08:50,390 --> 00:08:55,420
Until now, I fought only for my family or to win.

189
00:08:56,300 --> 00:09:02,470
But while you were my opponents, I tasted the true joy of playing football.

190
00:09:04,550 --> 00:09:07,060
This time Hyuga-kun breaks through with his power!

191
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,730
Even so...

192
00:09:08,730 --> 00:09:12,070
...I can't give up on winning!

193
00:09:12,070 --> 00:09:14,440
My football aims for victory.

194
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,320
It's an undefeated football!

195
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,360
A tackle from Ishizaki-kun!

196
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:22,120
But Hyuga-kun jumps and dodges it with wonderful timing!

197
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:25,870
Even if it's fun, it's meaningless if you lose!

198
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:29,250
Hyuga-kun immediately gets into shooting position!

199
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:31,630
In this situation, I can't let you score!

200
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,500
Tsubasa!

201
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:35,180
Tsubasa-kun jumps to block it!

202
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:37,420
Take it, Takeshi!

203
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:42,100
Hyuga-kun makes a quick decision and passes instead of shooting!

204
00:09:42,100 --> 00:09:44,650
The unmarked Sawada-kun runs.

205
00:09:44,650 --> 00:09:46,850
A goal chance for Meiwa!

206
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,850
Sawada-kun shoots!

207
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:53,650
Wakabayashi-kun saves it once again!

208
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:56,030
You did it!

209
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,990
Nice catch, Wakabayashi-san!

210
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:05,330
Despite it being a huge chance for Meiwa, with goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun's good play...

211
00:10:05,330 --> 00:10:06,870
...they still couldn't find the goal!

212
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,610
I'm sorry, Hyuga-san.

213
00:10:09,610 --> 00:10:11,380
Don't worry about it, Takeshi.

214
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:13,710
We still have 2 minutes.

215
00:10:13,710 --> 00:10:17,720
If I shoot every minute, we can win.

216
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:22,570
Just like Tsubasa and Misaki, Wakabayashi's leg is also injured.

217
00:10:22,570 --> 00:10:26,850
It was clear from the last save that his injury was serious.

218
00:10:26,850 --> 00:10:30,740
If I can shoot comfortably, I can break through the wall Wakabayashi has built.

219
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:33,160
We can win this match!

220
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:41,070
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

221
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:44,370
Nankatsu still leads 3-2.

222
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:46,510
Only 2 minutes left.

223
00:10:46,510 --> 00:10:50,160
The final match is about to be decided!

224
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,400
That goal was my fault.

225
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:55,040
I'll make up for it by doing karate!

226
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:59,800
Nankatsu will win if they hold onto the ball for the remaining time. What will happen?!

227
00:11:00,310 --> 00:11:02,220
Let's go, Wakabayashi-kun!

228
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:04,260
I'll keep attacking!

229
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:06,100
Alright, take it!

230
00:11:08,820 --> 00:11:12,640
Wakabayashi-kun collapses on the ground as he tries to throw the ball!

231
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,900
Wakabayashi-san!

232
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:21,900
It was clear there was pain in his left leg, but Wakabayashi-kun had never seemed to be in this much pain!

233
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:22,980
Now!

234
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:26,910
Taking advantage of this opportunity, Meiwa's Sawada-kun runs towards the goal!

235
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:28,160
I won't allow it!

236
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:31,350
Takasugi-kun clears it.

237
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:33,040
Nankatsu averted a huge danger.

238
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:36,540
But Wakabayashi-kun still hasn't been able to get up.

239
00:11:36,540 --> 00:11:39,510
Damn it! Is this as far as it goes?

240
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:41,020
Genzo!

241
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:43,260
Morisaki, start warming up.

242
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,090
Okay!

243
00:11:44,090 --> 00:11:46,000
Alright, that's it!

244
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,600
Wakabayashi is gone now.

245
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:50,100
As long as I shoot, it will be a goal.

246
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:52,520
Meiwa gets the cleared ball.

247
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,900
Let's go! Here's the chance!

248
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:59,530
Meiwa FC advances quickly towards the goal with a fast attack!

249
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:02,880
Everyone, we have to prevent them from shooting no matter what!

250
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,640
We'll get the ball back!

251
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,360
Yes!

252
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:11,370
Nankatsu captain Tsubasa-kun directs the defense and tightens it!

253
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:15,190
While it's impossible for Wakabayashi-kun to continue playing...

254
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:18,130
...Nankatsu brings on substitute goalkeeper Morisaki.

255
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:21,740
But a substitution can only be made when the ball is out of play or...

256
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:25,470
...when the game is stopped due to a foul.

257
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:28,530
As I thought, Nankatsu will take Wakabayashi off.

258
00:12:28,530 --> 00:12:31,390
I have to score before that happens!

259
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:33,890
Hyuga-kun runs towards the goal!

260
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,900
But Misaki-kun is right behind him!

261
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:40,780
I may not be able to continue playing duo play with Tsubasa-kun.

262
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:42,060
But I'll still defend!

263
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:45,110
I'll play for Nankatsu until the last drop of my strength!

264
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:48,070
I'll mark Kojiro!

265
00:12:48,070 --> 00:12:51,540
Star player Hyuga-kun is tightly marked by Misaki-kun!

266
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:54,130
Meiwa can't pass!

267
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:55,330
Here!

268
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:56,960
Let's steal the ball!

269
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:02,400
Damn it! Nankatsu is as stubborn as ever!

270
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:05,300
At this rate, it's over for us! We have to do something!

271
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:08,280
Less than a minute left.

272
00:13:07,450 --> 00:13:08,280
Stop them!

273
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:11,930
Will Nankatsu continue to prevent Meiwa from shooting?

274
00:13:11,930 --> 00:13:13,180
Damn it!

275
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:17,880
What is Meiwa doing?!

276
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:20,520
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun is coming!

277
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,150
I'll score the equalizing goal!

278
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:26,990
Meiwa pushes forward for one final attack with the whole team!

279
00:13:26,990 --> 00:13:28,200
Wakashimazu!

280
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,320
Takeshi!

281
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:33,490
Taking advantage of Misaki-kun's momentary lapse of attention, Hyuga-kun gets free!

282
00:13:33,490 --> 00:13:34,370
Hyuga-san!

283
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,610
Hyuga-kun receives the ball!

284
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:38,870
Alright, got it!

285
00:13:38,870 --> 00:13:39,880
What?!

286
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:41,190
I won't allow it!

287
00:13:41,190 --> 00:13:44,380
Tsubasa-kun fights for the ball with his last remaining strength!

288
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:48,880
Will Tsubasa-kun's sliding tackle come early...

289
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,390
...or Hyuga-kun's shot?!

290
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:54,140
The final struggle!

291
00:13:56,290 --> 00:13:58,520
His shot was faster!

292
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:01,310
A jumping volley from Hyuga-kun!

293
00:14:01,310 --> 00:14:03,410
Is it going in or not?!

294
00:14:03,410 --> 00:14:04,290
Damn it...

295
00:14:04,290 --> 00:14:05,490
I'm not going to give up.

296
00:14:05,490 --> 00:14:07,490
Only my left leg hurts.

297
00:14:07,490 --> 00:14:10,070
I still have one good leg!

298
00:14:10,070 --> 00:14:13,330
He jumps using his right foot!

299
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:14,450
What?!

300
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:17,700
But he can't reach it!

301
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:23,500
He saved it!

302
00:14:24,590 --> 00:14:25,960
Wakabayashi-san!

303
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:29,380
After jumping with his right foot, using his hand...

304
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:33,100
...he extended his reach and cleared the ball!

305
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,260
Meiwa can't equalize!

306
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:36,720
Alright, I'll clear it!

307
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:39,230
I won't allow it!

308
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:49,060
This is the karate move called the flying kick!

309
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:50,960
At this rate, they'll equalize!

310
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:51,680
That's it!

311
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:53,240
N-No way...

312
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:55,860
I can't let it go in.

313
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:58,280
I can't let this shot go in.

314
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:00,660
I have to stop it no matter what!

315
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:02,660
We will win!

316
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,760
He stopped it!

317
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,840
He stopped it right on the goal line!

318
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,580
