But Misaki-kun hits his head on the goal post because of his speed!

322
00:15:18,470 --> 00:15:19,680
Misaki!

323
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:23,340
If he hadn't run, he wouldn't have been able to stop the ball.

324
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:27,310
He took on this task fully aware that this would happen.

325
00:15:27,310 --> 00:15:31,640
