328
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,290
Tsubasa.

329
00:15:39,290 --> 00:15:40,560
Tsubasa...

330
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,520
Tsubasa.

331
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:42,440
Tsubasa.

332
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,290
Tsubasa.

333
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:45,540
