347
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:34,640
We lost the first match against Meiwa 7-6.

348
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:38,040
And now in the final, we're leading 3-2.

349
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:41,470
So our battle is tied!

350
00:16:41,470 --> 00:16:45,060
We need one more goal to truly become champions.

351
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:48,580
We'll score one more goal and become the true champions!

352
00:16:48,580 --> 00:16:49,820
Then I...

353
00:16:49,820 --> 00:16:52,900
Then I'll go to Brazil!

354
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:54,320
Stop him, Takeshi!

355
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,070
Okay!

356
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:01,580
I won't lose the ball to anyone!

357
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:04,370
I won't stop until I score!

358
00:17:04,370 --> 00:17:06,480
What happened, Sawada-kun?!

359
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:09,460
He's backing away without even reacting.

360
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:11,420
What fiery eyes...

361
