363
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:24,930
I'll steal the ball from you and put everything I have into a long shot from here.

364
00:17:24,930 --> 00:17:27,040
Bring it on, Hyuga Kojiro!

365
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,230
I won't lose!

366
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:31,980
